     "pass": 3,
     "source": "s13",
     "locator": "independent reviewer audit",
     "result": "supported",
     "at": "2026-10-10T12:55",
     "method": "independent reviewer (strict mode)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "text": "The original Transformer paper describes its decoder this way: it emits output one symbol at a time, feeding earlier outputs back in as extra input for the next step.",
